===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|scarf|lang=goh}}, from {{proto|Germanic|skarpaz|lang=de}}. Akin to Old Saxon {{term|skarp|lang=osx}}, compare Dutch {{term|scherp|lang=nl}}.

===Adjective===
{{de-adj|comparative=schärfer|superlative=schärfsten}}

# [[sharp]] (knife, intellect)
# [[hot]] (spicy)
# [[nipping]]
# [[hot]] (sexy)

